B6578;">64.4%</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:4px 8px;font-size:12.5px;color:#27324A;border-bottom:1px solid #EEF1F6;">BenchCAD 2.1</td><td align="right" style="padding:4px 8px;font-size:12.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #EEF1F6;font-weight:bold;color:#17693B;background:#E3F4EA;font-size:13px;">83.5</td><td align="right" style="padding:4px 8px;font-size:12.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #EEF1F6;color:#5B6578;">-</td><td align="right" style="padding:4px 8px;font-size:12.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #EEF1F6;color:#5B6578;">65.3</td></tr></table><div style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#8A94A8;padding-top:6px;">Green = best in the row. Anthropic's own launch numbers. Gemini 4 Carbon beats it on AutomationBench (53.9%). Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index: 65 at max effort.</div></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:12px 28px 0;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td style="border-left:3px solid #5B2FC2;padding:2px 0 2px 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#27324A;">
<div style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:bold;color:#5B2FC2;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;">WHY IT MATTERS TO YOU</div>Use Opus 5.5 for everyday work and Fable 5.2 for the hard jobs where other models stall: a whole pipeline refactor, an end-to-end model review, a stack of charts. At high effort it matched Opus 5.5 max on agentic coding at half the cost per task ($6.72 vs $12.82), even though its tokens cost 2x.</td>
</tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px 28px 0;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td bgcolor="#F0F4FF" style="background:#F0F4FF;padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#27324A;">
<div style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:bold;color:#2E4BE0;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;">TRY IT IN 5 MINUTES</div>Run one stuck task (say, a messy notebook into a tested module) on Fable 5.2 at medium effort and on Opus 5.5, then compare result, time and tokens. Claude Code: <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">/model fable</code> (2.1.321+). API: <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">claude-fable-5-2</code>.</td>
</tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px 28px 0;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#FBE7E7" style="background:#FBE7E7;padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#4A1414;"><div style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:bold;color:#A42727;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;">ACT TODAY</div>On Pro or a standard Team seat? Fable is included only until 1:29 PM IST today, and your free Fable reset expires then (Settings, Usage, Limit resets, Reset for free). After that it uses usage credits.</td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px 28px 0;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#27324A;"><div style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:bold;color:#8A5F00;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;">WATCH OUT</div><div style="padding-top:2px;">Prompts tuned on 5.1 may behave differently, API code that edits message history can now get 400 errors, and the benchmarks are Anthropic's own. Test on your own work before switching.</div></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px 28px 0;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#5B6578;"><b style="color:#101828;">Also new:</b> Fable 5.2 is on Bedrock, Google Cloud and Azure. Fast mode is up to 2.5x faster at double the price.</td></tr>
